<title>UK: Britannia buys Citibank mortgage portfolio.</title>
<headline>Britannia buys Citibank mortgage portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britannia Building Society said a subsidiary had bought a 1.1 billion stg portfolio of mortgages from Citibank for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>It said the portfolio contained some 30,000 residential mortgages ranging from straightforward variable rate repayment loans to special loans for people with small deposits or those wanting a fixed rate.</p>
<p>Britannia chief executive John Heaps said the purchase would &quot;contribute substantially to the Britannia Group's profit stream&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
